started/kubernetes/self-managed-onprem/onpremises#before-you-begin" class=
=3D"hash-link" aria-label=3D"Direct link to Before you begin..." title=3D"D=
irect link to Before you begin..." translate=3D"no">=E2=80=8B</a></h2>
<ul>
